                        "content": "The nurse is preparing a subcutaneous dose of bethanechol, prescribed for a client with urinary retention. Before giving the dose, the nurse checks to see that which medication is available on the emergency cart for use if needed?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "80db17ea97ed8fdcd1b6b9666390fca1",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Applying 应用",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nBethanechol is a cholinergic medication. Administration of bethanechol could result in cholinergic overdose. The antidote is atropine (an anticholinergic), which would be readily available for use if overdose occurs. Mucomyst is the antidote for acetaminophen overdose. Protamine sulfate is the antidote for heparin. Vitamin K is the antidote for warfarin.",
                        "id": "17a4e2d3f9024e449a02188da1bb1cb9",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "0b8c6fdc5999459285296cd6c41e4554",
                                "content": "With meals"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "f95219f3b0f0430991e101304355997c",
                                "content": "Two hours after meals"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "15ed6dc756584ddf8cdb61e603128052",
                                "content": "With a snack in the afternoon"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "24d5ea4604394e88b799496038a19b7e",
                                "content": "At bedtime with crackers and cheese"
